-- Warren Abstract Machine reference/integer/list profile.
-- Reference: Hassan Ait-Kaci, Warren's Abstract Machine: A Tutorial
-- Reconstruction (1991). Symbolic tape, 16 X registers, heap, trail and
-- choice points. CALL/PROCEED use VMWeave frames; no Y environments/functors.
-- CUT commits all current choices (not a predicate-local ISO Prolog cut).
-- Terminal logical failure is -11. See logic_machine.lua for shared semantics.
local here = debug.getinfo(1, "S").source:sub(2):match("^(.*)[/\\]") or "."
local build = dofile(here .. "/../logic_machine.lua")
return build("WAM", {})
